# Design System Plugin

This addon adds a design system foundation to your project with:

- **Design Tokens** (`src/lib/design-system/tokens.ts`): Centralized color, spacing, typography, and shadow definitions
- **Component Organization**: Structured folder layout for organizing UI, layout, navigation, feedback, data-display, and form components
- **Tailwind Integration**: Automatic CSS variable integration for design tokens in Tailwind
- **Documentation**: Complete design system guide in `docs/design-system.md`

## Quick Start

1. Import design tokens in your components:

```tsx
import { designTokens } from "@/lib/design-system";
```

2. Organize your components into categories:

- `src/components/ui/` — Primitive building blocks
- `src/components/layout/` — Page layout components
- `src/components/navigation/` — Nav, breadcrumbs, menus
- `src/components/feedback/` — Alerts, spinners, toasts
- `src/components/data-display/` — Tables, lists, grids
- `src/components/forms/` — Form inputs and fields

3. See `docs/design-system.md` for detailed usage and best practices.

## Files Added

- `src/lib/design-system/tokens.ts` — Design token definitions
- `src/lib/design-system/index.ts` — Barrel export
- `docs/design-system.md` — Complete design system documentation
